          <p>Points to consider while planning your budget: you cannot make significant reductions/savings on these figures. While planning finances, don't assume you'll be able to cut expenses much lower than this. If at all possible, bring about <strong>10 percent more</strong> than estimated expenditure, in case of unexpected costs and increases in German prices.</p>
