          <p>The list of stops starts on the left side and lists all stops in sequence until the last stop on the right. Then comes the actual timetable — departure times differ for weekdays, Saturdays, Sundays and public holidays; not all buses take the same routes on all days. In the timetable, the first colored column shows the "hour" (24h format), the next columns show the minutes — read time by combining the hour column with the minute columns.</p>
